<h3><u>Abbas chale aao</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Abbas chale aao, abbas chale aao..(4)</p>

<p>suno saqqa e haram, tumhe baccho ki qasam<br />
toot jaye na bharam, aao lehrake alam<br />
Abbas chale aao, abbas chale aao..(2)</p>

<p>1. Tum se to sakina ko badi aas hai ghaazi..(2)<br />
tum aao to manzoor hame pyaas hai ghaazi..(2)<br />
tum to dil e shabbir ka ehsaas hai ghaazi<br />
zara sunlo ye sada, aake tum behre khuda<br />
mera dum ghutne laga, ab to ghar laut ke aa<br />
Abbas chale aao, abbas chale aao..(2)</p>

<p>2. Tum baazu e shabbir ho lashkar ke alamdar..(2)<br />
tum saniye haider ho dil e jafar e tayyar..(2)<br />
tum sote ho haibat me pada aabid e beemar<br />
aag khaimo me lagi, sar se chadar bhi chini<br />
hai bohot tashna labi, ae jari ibn e jari<br />
Abbas chale aao, abbas chale aao..(2)</p>

<p>3. Lo shimr ne maara wo sakina ko tamacha..(2)<br />
kano se lahu behta hai jalne laga kurta..(2)<br />
masuma ko deta nahi koi bhi dilasa<br />
kya gawara hai tumhe, ae alamdar e wafa<br />
haath zainab ke bandhe, aur sakina ka gala<br />
Abbas chale aao, abbas chale aao..(2)</p>

<p>4. Pardes me ujde na koi aise gharana..(2)<br />
jis tarha se ujda mera ghar ae mere bhayya..(2)<br />
roti hui marqad se chali aai hai zehra<br />
labe darya pe sada, ashk aankho se rawa<br />
dilse uth ta hai dhua, dhundhe hum tum ko kaha<br />
Abbas chale aao, abbas chale aao..(2)</p>

<p>5. Parcham jo tera khu me bhara aaya hai bhayya..(2)<br />
kisne ye mere dil pe sitam dhaya hai bhayya..(2)<br />
pardes me taqdeer ne rulwaya hai bhayya<br />
kabse majboor hu mai, neher se door hu mai<br />
izn milta jo mujhe, lene khud aati tumhe<br />
Abbas chale aao, abbas chale aao..(2)</p>

<p>6. Lo shimr ne maara wo sakina ko tamacha..(2)<br />
kaano se lahu behta hai jalne laga kurta..(2)<br />
masooma ko deta nahi koi bhi dilasa<br />
kya gawara hai tumhe, ae alamdare wafa<br />
haath zainab ke bandhe, aur sakina ka gala<br />
Abbas chale aao, abbas chale aao..(2)</p>

<p>7. Meesum sare majlis ye teri girya o zaari..(2)<br />
rehaan ke lafzo pe bhi rik&#39;at hui taari..(2)<br />
dete hai dua ehle aza maa ko tumhari<br />
banke ek ajre karam, tumpe ghaazi ka alam<br />
har ghadi saya kare, dil yahi kehta rahe<br />
Abbas chale aao, abbas chale aao..(2)</p>

<p>suno saqqa e haram, tumhe baccho ki qasam<br />
toot jaye na bharam, aao lehrake alam<br />
Abbas chale aao, abbas chale aao..(2)</p>
